# SamlAssertion — an assertion that already signed someone in.
# Generated by `soli generate saml`.
# Collection: saml_assertions
#
# A bearer assertion is good for one sign-in: whoever holds a response that
# was used once (with the cookie that came with it) must not sign in with it
# again. `SamlSso.spend` keeps each assertion's id, under a `_key` derived
# from it, until the assertion expires; a create with a key already taken
# comes back with `_errors`.

class SamlAssertion < Model
end
